# compiled binaries. `go build ./...` inside tools/goldenharness leaves the
# harness here, and a cross-compiled one is worse than none: it is either the
# wrong platform for the recording host (`Exec format error`) or a stale build
# whose normalization rules predate the goldens it would re-record. The harness
# is always run from source — `go run ./tools/goldenharness` (README), or CI's
# `go build -o bin/goldenharness` — so nothing should ship a prebuilt one.
tools/goldenharness/goldenharness
tools/goldenharness/goldenharness.exe

# pytest
.pytest_cache/
